===Etymology===
From {{etyl|it|en}} {{term|passacaglia|lang=it}}, from {{etyl|es|en}} {{term|pasear||to walk|lang=es}} + {{term|calle||street|lang=es}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|music|lang=en}} A form of historical [[Spanish]] or [[Italian]] dance characterised by a serious nature, [[triple metre]], and use of a [[ground bass]].
# {{context|music|lang=en}} Any piece of [[classical music]] with similar characteristics.

